# Client build (required). These are the only variables that belong in a
# local .env — Vite inlines anything prefixed VITE_ into the browser bundle,
# so nothing secret may ever go here. The anon key is public by design; it
# is safe only because every table is behind RLS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# The same two values must also exist as Vercel project environment
# variables: api/sitemap.ts and middleware.ts read them via process.env.
#
# Edge function secrets are NOT set here. They live in Supabase and are
# listed in the README under "Edge function secrets" — a fresh project with
# none of them set still builds, deploys and serves the site, it just
# silently stops sending mail. Check them with `supabase secrets list`.
